Steps to create .bif and .sim formatted vectors from the BusTalk code 
------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. setenv TEST_ENV BUSTALK
2. make <option> e.g. make RegisterTest

(Refer to other options in the makefile in this directory.)

This will create infile.bif and bif.sim in the ./invec directory

